    "description": "Adapters are the link between the application and the rest of the universe. They take incoming data and shape them into an internal format, and vice-versa.\n\nAdapters are heavily used in hexagonal architecture. They are also a classic design pattern.\n\nAdapters are related to decoupling code. They bridge two pieces of code that evolve independently.\n",
